                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, throwing spear, javelins and Saxon buckler. May have light armour (+3). Light Infantry. Warband rules 1 and 2. The warlord's hearthguard. (The Age of Arthur p.50)</characteristic>
