  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="846c-35d5-8672-399b" name="Saxons: Saxon Kingdoms of the Heptarchy (Age of Arthur) - List Notes" publicationId="28aa-c13e-b61d-4f3e" hidden="false">
      <description>THE SAXONS: SAXON KINGDOMS OF THE HEPTARCHY (The Age of Arthur, pp.44-51). Units of Gedriht, Duguth and Geoguth may have a Leader (+5), Musician (+5) and Standard (+5).

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Saxons: Saxon Kingdoms of the Heptarchy]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Common Warriors: at least 33%
  Uncommon Warriors: up to 33%
  SAXON KINGDOMS OF THE HEPTARCHY. Characters up to 33% (any, except a Wiglera). Common warriors at least 33% (Gedriht, Duguth). Uncommon up to 33% (Ceorls, Geoguth, Skirmishers). Allies up to 25% from one list: Franks (Early Merovingian) or British and Welsh Kingdoms - Dumnonia and the South-West (Combrogi led by 0-1 Tiern or 0-1 Uchelwyr). Optional larger shields (documented only): replace all Saxon bucklers with shields, infantry become ordinary heavy infantry (+3 rank), M4, throwing spears may be exchanged for thrusting spears, Shieldwall allowed.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
